+
+## Configuration and Remaining Device Checks
+
+The separate **Testing** configuration substitutes only the external OS authenticator. Real store/repository/filesystem gates and UI remain under test. Normal Debug and Release use the real system adapter. The normal Run action is Debug, Archive is Release, and Testing archives are rejected. A test-double success does not establish successful real biometric/passcode interaction.
+
+Remaining checks: hardware Face ID/passcode cancellation/fallback/no-passcode cases, protected-data lock behavior, actual multi-window transitions, Quick Look/camera/editor app-switcher snapshots, full VoiceOver privacy, and Duo poses/reserved regions. The cover's native component test does not establish every system-controller capture path. Backup, sharing, retention, and organizational authorization findings remain open in the privacy audit.
+
